<mxCell id="rh71" value="Rules enforced by the database" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#e9e9e9;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1198.8" width="1820" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rb72" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:15px&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;zone_cells&lt;/b&gt; PK (property_id, row_idx, col_idx): one zone per spot. Composite FK (zone_id, property_id) → grid_zones (id, property_id): the zone must be from the same property. The grid is at most 60 × 60.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;lease_contracts.active_unit_id&lt;/b&gt; = rentable_unit_id while status = ACTIVE, otherwise NULL. UNIQUE: one ACTIVE lease per unit. &lt;b&gt;previous_lease_id&lt;/b&gt; UNIQUE: a lease can be renewed only once.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Closing a lease:&lt;/b&gt; closed_on is NULL only while the lease is ACTIVE; termination_reason only when TERMINATED; ended_automatically only when ENDED; released_on (move-out confirmed) only when ENDED or TERMINATED.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;payments.paid_lease_id&lt;/b&gt; = lease_id while status = PAID. UNIQUE (paid_lease_id, billing_month): a month is paid only once; FAILED attempts can repeat. PAID payments need reference_no and paid_at.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;lease_requests.pending_key&lt;/b&gt; = &quot;unit-renter&quot; while status = PENDING. UNIQUE: a renter has only one open request per unit. decided_at is NULL only while PENDING. unit_label and property_label keep the names if the unit is deleted.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;uploaded_files&lt;/b&gt;: exactly one owner column is filled, matching file_kind (PROPERTY_PHOTO / SITE_PLAN → property_id, UNIT_PHOTO → unit_id, CONTRACT → lease_id).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;ON DELETE CASCADE:&lt;/b&gt; property → zones → units / common areas / cells; property → edge_overrides; property, unit and lease → uploaded_files. &lt;b&gt;SET NULL:&lt;/b&gt; lease_requests.rentable_unit_id when a unit is deleted. &lt;b&gt;RESTRICT:&lt;/b&gt; users, units with leases (archive instead), leases with payments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CHECK values:&lt;/b&gt; role LANDLORD|RENTER · property_type APARTMENT|CONDOMINIUM|TOWNHOUSE|COMMERCIAL|NIGHT_MARKET|OPEN_SPACE · property status DRAFT|ACTIVE|ARCHIVED · unit status AVAILABLE|OCCUPIED|UNDER_MAINTENANCE|ARCHIVED · area_type WALKWAY|GRASS|BATHROOM|KITCHEN|LAUNDRY|LOBBY|PARKING|STAIRS · edge_type WALL|DOOR|WINDOW|OPEN · lease status ACTIVE|ENDED|TERMINATED|RENEWED · payment_terms MONTHLY_ADVANCE|MONTHLY_ARREARS|QUARTERLY_ADVANCE|SEMI_ANNUAL_ADVANCE|ANNUAL_ADVANCE · method GCASH|MAYA|CARD · payment status PENDING|PAID|FAILED · request status PENDING|APPROVED|DECLINED|CANCELLED · file_kind PROPERTY_PHOTO|SITE_PLAN|UNIT_PHOTO|CONTRACT.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Size columns&lt;/b&gt; (Dimensions): is_exact_size NULL = no size given; TRUE needs area_sqm; FALSE needs size_description. &lt;b&gt;Not stored&lt;/b&gt; (calculated in Java): automatic walls, LeaseState, DueStatus, RentDue, PaymentResult, the listing and layout previews.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1226.8" width="1820" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
