<mxCell id="x70" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Inheritance (class table).&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;grid_zones&lt;/b&gt; holds what every zone shares (GridZone). Each zone has exactly one extra row in &lt;b&gt;rentable_units&lt;/b&gt; (zone_kind = UNIT) or &lt;b&gt;common_areas&lt;/b&gt; (zone_kind = COMMON) with the same id." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1850" y="551" width="410" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
